= Paired t-Test <statistics_hypothesis_test_t_test_paired_t_test>

== Paired

$
t = macron(D) / (s_D / sqrt(n))
$

- $macron(D)$: mean of the differences between paired observations
- $s_D$: standard deviation of the differences
- $n$: number of pairs